  "worked_solution": "Two negations in a row cancel each other out. So:\n\n- we can simplify $¬(¬C)$ to $C,$ and\n\n- we can also simplify $¬(¬D)$ to $D.$\n\nTherefore, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\n¬(C∧D).\n$$",
